    "overview": "Intex Beast 18000 BT Portable Party Speaker Get ready to unleash the ultimate party experience with the Intex Beast 18000 BT, your all-in-one portable party speaker. Built to deliver massive 180W output, this powerhouse comes packed with dual 8\" woofers, dynamic RGB lighting, and multi-connectivity options including Bluetooth, USB, FM, Aux, and TWS. Whether you're throwing a house party, hosting a DJ night, or just jamming at home, the Beast 18000 ensures booming bass, crisp treble, and an immersive audio-visual vibe. Its built-in rechargeable battery offers extended playback for unstoppable entertainment. Plus, with dual mic input and remote control, you stay in command of your party playlist with ease.",
